(text "GPIO18 BCLK, GPIO19 LRCLK, GPIO21 DATA, GPIO26 amplifier enable.\nJ6 connects ONLY to audio J3 pins 3-7. Power is supplied separately from power J7.\nGround is carried with I2S; keep the harness short and away from switching inductors." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid abbf7b26-2a15-4a7a-9ac4-924b380f3a5d))
